{
  "name": "Keyword alerts from any RSS feed (jobs, tenders, listings)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ae9bb8e6-f998-5f11-a44a-f59e48fcbf2b",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"feeds\": [\n      \"https://example-jobs.com/feed\"\n    ],\n    \"hours_back\": 1,\n    \"keywords\": [\n      \"n8n\",\n      \"automation\"\n    ],\n    \"max_items\": 20,\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd0ea443-3dbb-5681-a7f9-305cf47ceca2",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $('Settings').first().json.config.feeds.map((url) => ({ json: { url } }));"
      },
      "id": "01e30d39-2542-530d-9e03-48ca1e619155",
      "name": "List feeds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "30a9bc2c-54ca-5731-a817-cff88198ac89",
      "name": "Read the feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nconst since = Date.now() - Number(cfg.hours_back || 24) * 3600000;\nconst kws = (cfg.keywords || []).map((k) => String(k).toLowerCase()).filter(Boolean);\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst items = [];\nfor (const { json: it } of $input.all()) {\n  if (!it || !it.link || it.error) continue;\n  const t = Date.parse(it.isoDate || it.pubDate || '');\n  if (!isNaN(t) && t < since) continue;\n  if (seen.has(it.link)) continue;\n  const text = String((it.title || '') + ' ' + (it.contentSnippet || it.content || '')).replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ');\n  if (kws.length && !kws.some((k) => text.toLowerCase().includes(k))) continue;\n  seen.add(it.link);\n  items.push({ title: String(it.title || '').trim(), link: it.link, published: it.isoDate || it.pubDate || '',\n    source: String(it.creator || it.author || '').trim(), snippet: text.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim().slice(0, 800) });\n}\nconst top = items.slice(0, Number(cfg.max_items) || 20);\nreturn top.map((i) => ({ json: i }));"
      },
      "id": "6adf60ea-d27b-5d3b-892a-bbeb8ffda269",
      "name": "Keep new items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.owner_email }}",
        "subject": "=New match: {{ $json.title }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.title }}\n\n{{ $json.snippet }}\n\n{{ $json.link }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "6ff198b5-0d57-57b6-996b-bf42911f3520",
      "name": "Email me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Keyword alerts from any RSS feed (jobs, tenders, listings)\nChecks RSS feeds every 30 minutes and emails you each new item that contains your keywords, for job boards, tenders, property or deal feeds.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "188d9e82-3414-51cc-b69c-1f212eaff38a",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Open **Settings** and list your RSS feed URLs (most blogs have `/feed` or `/rss`; a YouTube channel is `https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=...`). Put the words to look for in `keywords` (any one match counts).\n2. Connect Gmail on **Email me**.\n3. Run it once by hand and look at **Keep new items**, then switch to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "f362435d-1aaf-557f-bed1-b3ec0c978aa2",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -420
      ]
    }
  ],
